# xLaDe Projects

This directory contains the new projects or experiments for xLaDe.
In simple language, it stores the new projects which are not yet formal experiments and need help.

---

## Use

Create a new experiment in projects/ directory.
Here, you can ask for help, contribute to other experiments, help each other.
All the starting experiments and their ideas will be here.
Projects are transferred to experiments/ after the creation is completed.

---

## Current Status

This is meant for the users who will contribute to new experiments here.
Suppose you want to create a new experiment, and it needs help to be completed.
Then create it in projects/ and work here along with other community members.
After sufficient work, move it to experiments/ directory.

---
